# Docker files in root (use deploy/ subdirectory instead).
# Anchored: an unanchored `Dockerfile*` matches at every depth, so it was also
# ignoring deploy/Dockerfile.*, which is exactly where this rule tells you to
# put them. The existing deploy Dockerfiles are tracked only because they
# predate the rule; a new one silently failed to add.
/Dockerfile*

